T21 — six public examples + gallery (worker: devin-t21)
Worktree: original/worktrees/pdf-t21, base c696948

Implementation notes
- Six example cards under apps/web/public/examples/{amount,duplicates,
  geometry,reading-order,covered,scan}/ each with manifest.json,
  report.json (real captured sealed reports from scripts/capture.mjs
  matrix), and the real source PDF bytes.
- scripts/prepare_examples.py rewritten data-driven: derives each card's
  manifest from its captured report (fixture sha256, produced counts,
  reader identities, languages actually executed) — no hand-typed claims.
- apps/web/src/features/gallery/ — ExamplesGallery + loader + index;
  cards render on Home; each card links #/workspace?example=<id>.
- Workspace: initialExampleId prop fetches examples/<id>/report.json and
  runs it through the real session.offerFile import gate (never mounted
  directly); honest local error surface (role=alert) on fetch failure.
- tests/gallery/gallery.test.mjs — 5 node:test legs: manifest validates
  against canonical schema (AJV with $defs registered), PDF bytes match
  manifest sha256, report findings/languages match manifest claims,
  no padded cards (distinct fixture ids), total < static limit.
- tests/gallery/smoke.spec.ts — browser leg: gallery renders six cards;
  opening a card imports the real report and mounts the viewer.

